> Silver inks - the real ones you'd expect on a grimoire, not the cheap
> ones you get for well-meant self-made Christmas cards - often contain
> real silver as the colouring agent, much as gold inks contain real gold.
> Besides, I'd expect a "silver book" to have its cover inlaid with silver
